      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_06578691",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image shows Michelle Obama speaking into a microphone, with the text 'public talking' overlaid. The scene depicts a formal public speaking event. There is no toxicity present in this meme. The intent is to humorously or ironically label the act of public speaking as 'public talking,' which is a trivializing or self-deprecating play on words. It does not target any individual or group with harmful stereotypes, abuse, or hate. The meme's purpose is lighthearted and satirical, not malicious or propagandistic.",
