      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "public_talking",
      "label": "Public Speaking",
      "description": "The concept of public speaking is a real-world activity involving delivering speeches or presentations to an audience. The meme humorously labels this activity as 'public talking' to trivialize or satirize the formality of public speaking, implying it's merely talking in public. This requires background knowledge of public speaking as a formal event or activity.",
