      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Michelle_Obama",
      "label": "Former First Lady of the United States",
      "description": "Michelle Obama is the former First Lady of the United States, serving from 2009 to 2017. Her public speaking engagements are widely recognized and often involve significant audiences and formal settings. The meme references her public speaking, which requires background knowledge of her identity and role to understand the context of the humor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
